WEBVTT

00:09.926 --> 00:11.136
You're being too loud.

00:15.223 --> 00:16.224
Huh?

00:19.019 --> 00:20.478
Let's not cross the line.

00:20.979 --> 00:23.940
Ooh!

00:24.024 --> 00:25.150
What?

00:25.233 --> 00:26.234
He's crazy.

00:26.317 --> 00:28.153
Just gonna say it, whatever happens now.

00:28.862 --> 00:30.488
Nice.

00:30.989 --> 00:32.157
Today's the day!

00:32.240 --> 00:34.117
- Ooh.
- Today's the day!

00:34.701 --> 00:36.536
Yeon Si-eun, you son of a bitch.

00:36.619 --> 00:38.955
Did you know I've been letting
you off easy all this time?

00:39.039 --> 00:40.665
You didn't, huh?

00:41.249 --> 00:42.792
Ooh!

00:42.876 --> 00:44.586
- Yeah!
- Damn, bro!

00:45.920 --> 00:48.048
- See that?
- Yeah, that was a good one.

00:48.131 --> 00:50.675
- He looks insane.
- He's back.

00:50.759 --> 00:53.511
He's crazy, man.

00:53.595 --> 00:55.680
Look at his eyes.

00:55.764 --> 00:57.015
Bro, he's like…

00:57.098 --> 00:58.850
- Somethin' seriously…
- Hah!

00:59.392 --> 01:00.518
Aah.

01:01.936 --> 01:03.063
Ooh! Ooh!

01:06.107 --> 01:07.609
What are they doing?

01:08.193 --> 01:09.944
Come on, come on.

01:10.028 --> 01:11.362
Again?

01:28.546 --> 01:31.966
Hey, you can take a blow, yeah?
You sure can, my guy!

01:56.199 --> 02:01.371
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

02:56.342 --> 02:58.136
MAKE IT TO THE TOP, BAKSAL

02:58.219 --> 02:59.721
Ugh, tell me about it.

02:59.804 --> 03:02.849
He only got suspended.
Why can't he compete in the tournament?

03:02.932 --> 03:04.976
He didn't drop out or get expelled.

03:05.059 --> 03:07.896
So why did Baku
go around getting into fights,

03:07.979 --> 03:09.189
even though he was our captain?

03:09.272 --> 03:10.315
Hey.

03:10.398 --> 03:11.274
PARK HU-MIN

03:11.357 --> 03:14.235
How many times do I have to tell you
he didn't get into fights?

03:14.319 --> 03:15.445
You're right.

03:16.112 --> 03:17.697
I doubt it was a fight.

03:18.740 --> 03:21.034
Baku probably just beat the other guy.

03:21.117 --> 03:22.994
- Yeah, he beat his ass.
- So true.

03:23.077 --> 03:24.621
Must've freaking hurt.

03:24.704 --> 03:26.122
Are they even alive?

03:26.206 --> 03:27.498
Damn it!

03:27.582 --> 03:29.751
- Oh, shit.
- Fucking really?

03:29.834 --> 03:31.085
Little shit.

03:31.169 --> 03:32.629
- Hey.
- Bro has a short temper.

03:32.712 --> 03:35.256
I can't just wait.
I'll go talk to the teacher.

03:35.340 --> 03:37.050
We legit need to play that tournament.

03:37.133 --> 03:39.177
Hey, hey, hey. Don't do it.

03:39.260 --> 03:40.720
Hey, Hyun-tak!

03:42.305 --> 03:43.598
- Bro, bro--
- Let go.

03:43.681 --> 03:46.100
- Hey!
- Choi Hyo-man's freaking lost it!

03:46.976 --> 03:49.854
- Hey, come quick!
- This sounds fucking fun, man!

03:49.938 --> 03:51.481
What the fuck is going on?

03:52.815 --> 03:55.568
- Choi Hyo-man?
- That shithead.

03:56.319 --> 03:58.696
He's bullying someone
since Baku's not around.

03:59.572 --> 04:01.282
He was quiet for way too long.

04:04.285 --> 04:07.121
This drives me nuts.
I'm sick of it.

04:07.205 --> 04:08.748
- Fight!
- What's goin' on?

04:08.831 --> 04:10.708
- Dude, it's crazy.
- I can't see.

04:10.792 --> 04:12.460
- I can't see! Move over!
- No.

04:12.543 --> 04:15.046
- What are they doing?
- Get out of my way. Move.

04:15.129 --> 04:16.589
- Move.
- Who's this guy?

04:17.340 --> 04:18.383
Ooh!

04:18.466 --> 04:20.176
Right down!

04:28.309 --> 04:29.727
- Oh.
- He's walkin'.

04:29.811 --> 04:32.689
- This guy's serious.
- He just keeps gettin' up.

04:33.523 --> 04:35.024
You… you don't mess with crazy.

04:35.108 --> 04:38.361
Hey, you can take a blow, yeah?
You sure can, my guy!

04:39.779 --> 04:42.115
I need to spot the moment
his shoulder opens up.

04:45.368 --> 04:46.452
Ooh!

04:47.620 --> 04:48.830
It's like a movie.

04:48.913 --> 04:50.164
Are you seeing this?

04:50.248 --> 04:52.208
Shit! Fuck!

04:53.167 --> 04:54.419
He's mad!

04:54.919 --> 04:56.671
Goddamn!

04:56.754 --> 04:58.506
- Fuck!
- Oh, my locker!

04:58.589 --> 05:01.217
Always the same, bro.

05:01.843 --> 05:04.345
- Happens once a week.
- Hey. Are you kidding me with this?

05:04.429 --> 05:06.931
This fucking asshole.

05:07.598 --> 05:08.433
Hey!

05:09.934 --> 05:12.603
Why the fuck are you looking at me? Hey!

05:13.354 --> 05:15.231
What the hell are you trying to prove?

05:16.024 --> 05:16.941
Hey!

05:18.067 --> 05:21.195
Aah! What the hell,
you goddamn motherfucker?

05:21.279 --> 05:22.363
Hey!

05:27.368 --> 05:28.745
Oh.

05:29.329 --> 05:33.041
Look at this dumbass Hyo-man.
Is living your life like this fun?

05:33.124 --> 05:37.253
Yeah, it's freaking fun. You can leave.
I'm busy, so go bother someone else, man.

05:37.337 --> 05:39.714
Stop lying, bro.
You don't look fucking busy to me.

05:41.090 --> 05:43.801
Why do I have to leave
just because you want?

05:43.885 --> 05:46.929
Catch your breath first.
You look exhausted, stupid baby-ass.

05:47.013 --> 05:50.350
"Baby-ass"? You're the baby-ass,
you Baku's little minion.

05:50.933 --> 05:53.102
Oh, you're cosplaying as him, aren't you?

05:55.313 --> 05:56.814
This motherfucker.

05:59.108 --> 06:00.526
What did you just say to me?

06:03.780 --> 06:04.822
Say that again.

06:10.078 --> 06:12.330
You're just Baku's minion.
Happy now, you asshole?

06:12.413 --> 06:14.415
If you didn't have
fucking Baku on your side…

06:19.420 --> 06:21.506
Ooh!

06:24.384 --> 06:25.718
Hyo-man-a.

06:25.802 --> 06:28.137
I can take you down
in a split second. Okay?

06:28.888 --> 06:29.847
So?

06:31.057 --> 06:32.392
Wanna go to the gym?

06:36.979 --> 06:38.314
That disgusting gym?

06:38.898 --> 06:40.733
The slippery floor's awful there.

06:40.817 --> 06:42.819
I'll take you down soon though, idiot.

06:43.444 --> 06:44.946
And you too, motherfucker!

06:46.406 --> 06:47.657
Move, or I'll make you!

06:48.825 --> 06:50.827
- He told you to move it.
- Damn.

06:50.910 --> 06:54.205
- What are you laughing at?
- Gotak does come after Baku.

06:54.288 --> 06:56.541
- What are you lookin' at?
- Fuck.

06:56.624 --> 06:58.543
- That was cool, Gotak.
- Guys!

06:58.626 --> 07:02.213
Hey, well, it'd be awkward
if you thanked me now. You can do it…

07:18.938 --> 07:20.940
Let's go see the nurse.

07:36.372 --> 07:37.373
Hey.

07:38.749 --> 07:40.168
I mean, It's not like, you know,

07:40.251 --> 07:43.337
I wanted to hear you thank me
for helping or anything like that,

07:44.088 --> 07:45.423
but it'd be kinda nice.

07:46.424 --> 07:48.718
I can't tell if you're being rude
or just a jerk.

07:50.261 --> 07:51.220
Okay.

07:51.721 --> 07:52.722
Thank you.

08:01.898 --> 08:03.232
What's with that guy?

08:18.748 --> 08:20.082
What are you doing?

08:21.083 --> 08:22.835
We're going to the nurse's office.

08:23.669 --> 08:27.006
Oh, we can't go to the nurse's office.

08:42.271 --> 08:43.648
Oh, if we…

08:46.192 --> 08:47.860
…go to the nurse's office,

08:49.654 --> 08:51.447
they always make a big deal.

08:52.532 --> 08:55.368
And Hyo-man always gets called
to the teacher's office.

08:56.911 --> 08:58.955
Then we just get beaten up again.

09:00.748 --> 09:02.333
It's been an endless cycle.

09:06.087 --> 09:10.716
The main ingredient of
Fucidin is antibiotics.

09:11.300 --> 09:13.761
So, you have to put Fucidin on the wound

09:14.262 --> 09:17.306
if you think it could get infected.

09:19.225 --> 09:20.268
Because

09:21.811 --> 09:25.064
Hyo-man's punches are germy and nasty.

09:27.858 --> 09:29.110
Why'd you do it?

09:32.530 --> 09:33.656
Huh?

09:35.283 --> 09:37.368
Why did you return everyone's phones?

09:37.451 --> 09:38.411
Oh.

09:42.081 --> 09:43.666
Because of Newton's third law.

09:44.959 --> 09:48.379
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

09:52.717 --> 09:54.468
That's not what it means.

09:58.431 --> 09:59.640
Jun-tae, are you okay?

09:59.724 --> 10:01.267
Jun-tae, are you all right?

10:01.350 --> 10:03.394
Oh my. Jun-tae-kun. Oh God.

10:03.978 --> 10:06.564
It was a very close call
out there for me today.

10:07.732 --> 10:09.734
My vision suddenly went dark.

10:09.817 --> 10:11.652
Then back to normal.

10:11.736 --> 10:13.738
But I…

10:13.821 --> 10:16.365
I was saved with honey hotteok. 

10:16.449 --> 10:19.452
Good ol' honey hotteok.

10:19.535 --> 10:24.624
Choi Hyo-man. One day, I shall seize
your breaths with my single sword.

10:24.707 --> 10:27.418
- Not yet. It's not the time yet.
- Okay.

10:28.336 --> 10:29.462
You're right.

10:36.302 --> 10:37.345
Fuck, man.

10:37.428 --> 10:38.638
NO FIGHTING
BAKU

10:38.721 --> 10:41.557
It was awesome to finally watch
a fight at Eunjang. It's been a while.

10:41.641 --> 10:43.601
- It was great, not gonna lie.
- Yeah, it was badass.

10:43.684 --> 10:46.145
Yeah, but, still, you can't
really call what happened a fight.

10:46.228 --> 10:47.438
- You know?
- Why not?

10:47.521 --> 10:49.732
Yeon Si-eun didn't even,
like, throw a punch.

10:49.815 --> 10:51.609
- How is that a fight?
- Yeah.

10:51.692 --> 10:54.153
- But he could definitely take a beating.
- Yeah.

10:54.236 --> 10:57.281
But Yeon Si-eun's eyes are like…
They're really weird.

10:58.115 --> 11:00.868
- He's like a total psychopath.
- Exactly.

11:00.951 --> 11:04.747
Seeing him today,
the rumors about him have to be true.

11:04.830 --> 11:07.667
That's probably the reason Hyo-man's
been avoiding him all this time.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.919
- Seriously, man.
- Bro, I was a total simp today.

11:10.002 --> 11:12.380
- Why simp for him? Simp for me.
- Bro was sigma as fuck today.

11:12.463 --> 11:13.547
I'm a really good fighter.

11:13.631 --> 11:15.925
- I can dodge everything.
- You'd get your ass kicked.

11:16.008 --> 11:17.635
- Cut your bullshit.
- Hey, you guys.

11:18.761 --> 11:19.887
What are you talking about?

11:19.970 --> 11:22.056
Why would Hyo-man avoid Si-eun?

11:22.682 --> 11:24.809
Hey, do you

11:24.892 --> 11:27.311
actually go to our school, or not?

11:27.395 --> 11:28.396
Tell me.

11:29.563 --> 11:30.815
Last year,

11:30.898 --> 11:33.067
Yeon Si-eun had beef with Hyo-man

11:33.150 --> 11:35.152
as soon as he transferred here
from his other school.

11:35.236 --> 11:36.237
Mm-hmm.

11:36.320 --> 11:40.449
So Hyo-man, he called everyone
in Yeon Si-eun's old neighborhood.

11:40.950 --> 11:43.369
He had to find out more
about why he transferred to our school.

11:44.620 --> 11:46.789
- What'd he find?
- Fuck, man.

11:46.872 --> 11:49.208
Yeon Si-eun practically
incapacitated some kids.

11:49.291 --> 11:52.712
He slammed a kid with a dumbbell.
Stabbed another in the neck with scissors!

11:53.295 --> 11:54.755
Holy shit.

11:54.839 --> 11:56.549
He's infamous for that
in that neighborhood.

11:56.632 --> 11:58.676
Insane. Hyo-man's pride was crushed,

11:58.759 --> 12:00.386
but he still couldn't
lay a hand on Si-eun.

12:00.469 --> 12:01.637
He just talks big.

12:01.721 --> 12:03.848
- Right.
- Fucker!

12:07.351 --> 12:08.686
What the hell?

12:09.270 --> 12:11.689
- I'm not gonna believe that bullshit.
- It's legit.

12:11.772 --> 12:13.774
Hey. Yeon Si-eun's basically a genius.

12:13.858 --> 12:15.151
Tell me why he'd be at Eunjang?

12:15.234 --> 12:19.238
He got banned from all the other schools
because of all the crazy shit he pulled.

12:22.408 --> 12:24.285
Let's go see the nurse.

12:26.412 --> 12:27.413
Hey.

12:32.168 --> 12:33.210
Okay.

12:34.211 --> 12:35.379
Thank you.

12:37.506 --> 12:38.507
Hey, guys.

12:39.091 --> 12:43.053
Don't talk behind people's back
with unconfirmed rumors, okay?

12:45.014 --> 12:46.766
Gross. You reek of cigarettes.

12:47.641 --> 12:49.393
- That was freaking cool.
- What was?

12:49.477 --> 12:51.061
What was freaking cool?

12:51.145 --> 12:52.313
- Cut it out.
- What was that?

13:02.865 --> 13:04.116
What are you doing here?

13:05.618 --> 13:07.953
- Why do you care?
- I said what are you doing?

13:10.539 --> 13:12.124
Just mind your own business.

13:20.007 --> 13:22.635
Hyo-man must be freaking humiliated.

13:22.718 --> 13:23.803
What do you think?

13:23.886 --> 13:26.305
- Could I beat Hyo-man in a fight?
- Hell to the no, bro.

13:26.388 --> 13:27.681
- I might win.
- He still has game.

13:27.765 --> 13:29.308
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.

13:36.982 --> 13:39.610
- What did that prick Gotak say?
- What?

13:40.528 --> 13:43.364
Nothing.
Oh, he really didn't say that much.

13:45.407 --> 13:46.951
He… he just said

13:48.160 --> 13:50.412
Si-eun didn't seem like
a psychopath to him.

13:51.997 --> 13:54.375
He told us not to talk shit
behind his back.

13:56.126 --> 13:58.587
- Gotak seemed to be on Si-eun's side.
- Yes.

13:58.671 --> 14:01.215
Why is that fucker acting so nice?

14:07.721 --> 14:10.641
Ungra… ted? Ungrat…

14:10.724 --> 14:12.977
Ungrate… What the fuck was that word?

14:13.060 --> 14:14.436
- Hey, hey, hey.
- Hm?

14:14.520 --> 14:15.563
- Yeah?
- Yes?

14:15.646 --> 14:17.481
Do you know
what this feels like?

14:18.107 --> 14:19.692
- What?
- Wh… what?

14:20.568 --> 14:23.571
When a piece of shit you covered for
stabs you in the back.

14:26.448 --> 14:28.367
It can be pretty damn annoying.

14:29.159 --> 14:30.160
Right?

14:34.373 --> 14:35.416
Si-eun-a.

14:39.044 --> 14:40.087
Uh…

14:40.796 --> 14:41.672
Um…

14:42.882 --> 14:45.926
I got some lutein and magnesium.

14:46.677 --> 14:49.221
Lutein is good for your eyes
when you study hard,

14:49.305 --> 14:52.391
and I hear magnesium helps you
to sleep better.

14:55.019 --> 14:58.314
You seem to sleep a lot at school.

15:05.738 --> 15:07.114
Thank you for today.

15:09.450 --> 15:11.160
See you tomorrow. Bye.

15:16.749 --> 15:18.334
What's your first secret?

15:18.417 --> 15:21.462
Well, above everything else,
sleep is the most important.

15:22.046 --> 15:25.007
If you don't get enough sleep,
you'll have trouble remembering

15:25.090 --> 15:27.468
even the things you know extremely well.

15:27.551 --> 15:28.385
SLEEPING PILLS

15:28.469 --> 15:30.346
And you'll be unable
to do things you're good at.

15:30.429 --> 15:32.973
So it's very important
to get a good night's sleep.

15:33.057 --> 15:34.350
I believe you're right.

15:34.433 --> 15:38.270
I remember forcing myself to sleep
the day before the college entrance exam.

15:38.354 --> 15:42.733
But when I tried to force myself to sleep,
it only made it harder to fall asleep.

15:42.816 --> 15:44.902
Do you have a secret to falling asleep,
Do-yeon-ssi?

15:44.985 --> 15:47.196
Oh, yes.
I had a similar experience

15:47.279 --> 15:50.741
when I couldn't sleep well the day before
the mock college entrance exam in June.

15:50.824 --> 15:51.700
I see.

15:51.784 --> 15:54.411
I was so sleepy the next day
as I took the mock exam.

15:55.037 --> 15:59.041
Since then, I've incorporated always
taking a warm bath when I couldn't sleep…

16:24.316 --> 16:25.859
You're not sleepy today?

16:26.735 --> 16:28.404
You're awake during lunch.

16:32.241 --> 16:34.785
Your pills seemed to have worked.

16:36.495 --> 16:37.538
Which one?

16:38.580 --> 16:39.581
Magnesium?

16:41.458 --> 16:42.292
Thanks.

16:44.712 --> 16:45.671
No worries.

16:48.173 --> 16:50.592
Ah, Si-eun-a. Do you take multivitamins?

16:51.093 --> 16:52.678
There's this really good one I have.

16:52.761 --> 16:55.014
You should try mine
when we go back upstairs.

16:55.097 --> 16:57.349
It's important
to take multivitamins every day.

16:57.850 --> 17:01.562
You have to take it 30 minutes after
your meals to prevent any stomach damage.

17:02.146 --> 17:04.481
It's great. If you continue
to take it, you won't--

17:04.565 --> 17:05.941
Why don't you talk

17:07.735 --> 17:09.403
after you swallow your food?

17:11.113 --> 17:13.073
Right. Yep.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.665
Ungrateful.

17:22.833 --> 17:24.418
Ungrateful.

17:28.672 --> 17:29.673
Huh.

17:32.509 --> 17:34.636
- It's strange.
- Hey, block! Block it!

17:35.220 --> 17:37.347
He's open on the other side.
Hey, the other… Go, go!

17:37.431 --> 17:41.226
I've never, ever been at peace
during lunchtime before.

17:41.310 --> 17:43.937
- Pass it to me! I said pass it!
- I've been feeling anxious.

17:44.021 --> 17:45.022
Go!

17:45.105 --> 17:46.482
Step it up a little, yeah?

17:46.565 --> 17:47.775
Sorry, man.

17:47.858 --> 17:49.610
- Hey, go on! Pass it…
- Go on!

17:49.693 --> 17:51.487
Pass them down! Pass it!

17:51.570 --> 17:53.322
Hey, friends!

17:54.490 --> 17:55.866
Is this where you've been?

17:55.949 --> 17:57.951
I've been looking everywhere for you two.

17:58.577 --> 18:00.204
Oh my goodness.

18:00.287 --> 18:02.039
Aah! Hey, there.

18:04.041 --> 18:06.627
Si-eun-a, bro, I feel bad about yesterday.

18:06.710 --> 18:08.295
I have some serious anger issues.

18:08.378 --> 18:10.756
But I'm really sorry, man. Okay, my guy?

18:10.839 --> 18:13.258
Jun-tae. Hey, Jun-tae!
I'm sorry about that, okay?

18:14.301 --> 18:15.344
Okay.

18:16.095 --> 18:17.971
Pass forward. Forward.

18:18.055 --> 18:19.848
Hey. Hands off.

18:21.266 --> 18:24.269
Okay!
All right, all right, all right.

18:24.353 --> 18:26.897
Don't be so hard on me
when I came to apologize, huh?

18:28.148 --> 18:30.317
Ahem. I came by to let you know something.

18:30.901 --> 18:33.195
You see that punk-ass in blue over there?

18:33.737 --> 18:35.864
You know, the guy who butt in yesterday?

18:37.074 --> 18:38.909
His name is Go Hyun-tak.

18:38.992 --> 18:41.995
He struts around saying he's part
of the basketball team or whatever,

18:42.079 --> 18:44.206
but all he is is fucking pretentious.

18:44.289 --> 18:45.541
He's just a delinquent.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.127
Just warning ya.

18:49.253 --> 18:51.505
Watch your back.

18:53.006 --> 18:55.509
Apparently,
Go Hyun-tak really wants to kick your ass.

19:01.181 --> 19:03.767
- Hey! Nice job, Ju-seong!
- Dude, what the hell?

19:03.851 --> 19:04.852
You're a huge guy.

19:04.935 --> 19:06.895
- Why couldn't you block it?
- He came into the end…

19:06.979 --> 19:08.814
- Bro, I mean, you're this tall.
- He was like…

19:08.897 --> 19:10.524
It's not that.
You should've kept blocking.

19:10.607 --> 19:12.067
- Take the ball.
- Come on, man.

19:14.528 --> 19:17.614
What the heck's this?
Why is Choi Hyo-man with Si-eun?

19:18.198 --> 19:19.658
Are they making up?

19:19.741 --> 19:20.868
No way.

19:24.121 --> 19:26.832
That shithead keeps glaring
over here at you.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.001
I'll talk to him. You stay here.

19:40.971 --> 19:42.764
Go somewhere else.
We don't want you over here.

19:44.474 --> 19:48.145
I only came over here 'cause your stare
was burning a hole in my heart.

19:50.063 --> 19:52.065
If you have something to tell me,
tell me now.

19:56.028 --> 19:57.863
What's going on between you and Si-eun?

19:58.488 --> 20:00.866
I heard Si-eun was
a top dog at his former school,

20:00.949 --> 20:03.410
and so I wanted to be his friend.

20:04.244 --> 20:05.120
Who knows?

20:05.621 --> 20:08.665
He might be helpful in killing both
you and Baku, that son of a bitch.

20:09.416 --> 20:11.835
I should've fucking done that
a long time ago, shouldn't I?

20:11.919 --> 20:14.129
- Motherfucker, do you have a death wish?
- Hey, hey!

20:14.213 --> 20:15.672
This is school violence!

20:15.756 --> 20:17.507
- School violence!
- Let go of me.

20:21.386 --> 20:23.972
You shouldn't do that
on these sacred school grounds.

20:24.056 --> 20:26.433
Hey, Si-eun-a!
I'll see you at the intersection later.

20:26.516 --> 20:28.060
I'll call you later. Bye!

20:29.686 --> 20:31.897
Just go back
to practicing your shots, guys.

20:51.959 --> 20:54.044
Si-eun-a, I'm going to use the restroom.

20:55.420 --> 20:56.546
Hmm.

21:01.677 --> 21:03.887
Jun-tae-ya, come with us.

21:03.971 --> 21:05.472
- Why?
- You have a new mission.

21:05.555 --> 21:08.016
Let's help out Hyo-man
a little. Okay?

21:11.019 --> 21:12.771
- You need to practice!
- You should step it up.

21:12.854 --> 21:14.940
- Follow your own advice.
- My height's all that matters.

21:15.023 --> 21:16.775
- You both need to pass the ball to me.
- Ugh!

21:16.858 --> 21:18.819
- Ju-seong-a, you were bad too.
- Why don't you pass?

21:18.902 --> 21:21.571
- After school?
- You just need to go practice.

21:21.655 --> 21:24.157
I dribble a lot better than you do.

21:24.241 --> 21:26.994
You dreaming, bro?
I can't believe this.

21:27.077 --> 21:29.663
Believe it. Your height is not
gonna save you forever.

21:29.746 --> 21:32.040
When'd you stop growing?
Middle school?

21:39.923 --> 21:42.175
Excuse me, all.

21:45.512 --> 21:47.681
Ew, it fuckin' stinks in here.

21:49.141 --> 21:51.101
These pricks. Hm?

22:00.360 --> 22:02.362
Damn it, I missed that fucking pass!

22:09.786 --> 22:11.413
Stupid motherfuckers!

22:19.629 --> 22:21.298
Those little fucks.

22:25.218 --> 22:27.679
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4
SEO JUN-TAE

22:27.763 --> 22:30.098
Please stop doing
unnecessary things,

22:30.182 --> 22:32.434
whether it be at school
or outside of school, okay?

22:33.226 --> 22:35.604
You need to stop drinking. All right?

22:35.687 --> 22:36.938
And no more smoking.

22:37.606 --> 22:39.066
Whose empty seat is that? Huh?

22:40.317 --> 22:41.318
Whose is it?

22:42.319 --> 22:43.528
Where's Seo Jun-tae?

22:44.404 --> 22:45.364
Huh?

22:47.866 --> 22:50.243
He hasn't been around since fifth period.

22:50.327 --> 22:51.995
- Bro.
- What?

22:52.079 --> 22:53.914
- What did he say?
- He can speak!

22:53.997 --> 22:55.582
- What the hell?
- For real?

22:56.083 --> 22:58.960
What's gotten into you, Si-eun?
Are you speaking up in class?

22:59.044 --> 23:00.212
It's not that.

23:01.254 --> 23:04.257
- What if something bad happ--
- Nothing happened to him, I'm sure.

23:05.175 --> 23:07.677
Tell Jun-tae to come see me right away
when he comes tomorrow.

23:07.761 --> 23:10.097
Class dismissed.

23:13.266 --> 23:17.312
Man, that took so fucking long.
I almost started to bleed from my ears.

23:18.730 --> 23:21.483
SEO JUN-TAE

23:25.904 --> 23:28.573
The number you have dialed
is not available.

23:28.657 --> 23:30.951
- Please leave a message.
- Hey, Si-eun-a.

23:32.244 --> 23:34.871
Is Jun-tae doing okay? Huh?

23:34.955 --> 23:37.457
I saw Gotak dragging him
all the way to the clubroom.

23:38.959 --> 23:43.046
Where the basketball club meets.
You know, the club next to the annex.

23:43.922 --> 23:44.965
You should go.

23:55.559 --> 23:57.436
I'm a freaking genius!

24:02.441 --> 24:03.859
Badass.

24:05.402 --> 24:06.445
Badass.

24:58.413 --> 24:59.456
Si-eun-a.

25:02.417 --> 25:03.585
Are you okay?

25:04.586 --> 25:05.795
Uh…

25:08.256 --> 25:10.675
Choi Hyo-man, right?

25:23.897 --> 25:25.065
Uh…

25:26.483 --> 25:27.901
Go Hyun-tak?

25:29.736 --> 25:30.946
Go Hyun-tak?

25:35.575 --> 25:36.576
Huh?

25:38.411 --> 25:42.332
Uh… Yeon Si-eun wants to see you.

25:45.126 --> 25:46.419
For what, though?

25:48.630 --> 25:50.215
He wants to fight you.

25:50.799 --> 25:52.801
Uh… um, Hyo-man

25:53.635 --> 25:55.220
and Si-eun teamed up

25:55.887 --> 25:58.223
to beat up Baku and you together.

26:01.643 --> 26:03.687
He said he'll be waiting

26:04.354 --> 26:05.647
in your clubroom.

26:06.773 --> 26:08.275
He said come quickly.

26:08.858 --> 26:11.236
He said Baku's minion was a piece of cake.

26:20.370 --> 26:21.496
Damn it.

26:23.331 --> 26:24.583
Hey, Yeon Si-eun!

26:32.132 --> 26:33.133
Hey!

26:35.260 --> 26:38.471
What the fuck is his problem?

26:44.603 --> 26:46.229
That fuckin' asshole.

27:12.047 --> 27:14.924
Attention, please.
It's the last time I'm explaining.

27:15.008 --> 27:16.718
We'll come in right after
they're exhausted

27:16.801 --> 27:18.094
from their fight with each other!

27:18.178 --> 27:20.805
All right? You got it?
Kicking Gotak's ass is priority,

27:20.889 --> 27:23.183
and if we have time
to kick Si-eun's punk ass, we will.

27:23.266 --> 27:25.810
Yeah? Now, first Gotak,
then Si-eun. Again.

27:25.894 --> 27:28.146
- First Gotak, then Si-eun.
- First Gotak, then Si-eun.

27:28.229 --> 27:29.773
Yeah! Good! Nice!

27:35.070 --> 27:37.155
Si-eun-a, do you usually go this way?

27:41.201 --> 27:42.452
Yeah, why?

27:43.328 --> 27:46.164
Well, uh, this is a good shortcut.

27:47.040 --> 27:49.918
But you should probably
stay away from this area.

27:50.669 --> 27:54.964
This is where delinquents take kids' money
and get into fights with each other.

27:56.925 --> 27:59.010
This is where I first met Hyo-man.

28:00.845 --> 28:03.932
Well, Baku, of course,
made sure everything quieted down,

28:05.058 --> 28:06.434
but you never know.

28:09.479 --> 28:11.314
A detour would be a waste of time.

28:12.941 --> 28:14.734
Well, that's true.

28:14.818 --> 28:18.446
EUNJANG HIGH, NO FIGHTING
BAKU

28:24.119 --> 28:25.036
Hey!

28:27.414 --> 28:29.749
Oh… Go Hyun-tak?

28:31.042 --> 28:33.294
Hah. I got you, mother…

28:43.638 --> 28:44.889
Who do you think you are?

28:46.599 --> 28:47.851
Why'd you come into our clubroom

28:47.934 --> 28:50.437
and tear everything to shreds,
you fucking dickhead?

28:50.937 --> 28:52.105
I think

28:53.398 --> 28:55.650
there must have been
a bit of a misunderstanding.

28:55.734 --> 28:57.110
Stay in your lane.

28:58.570 --> 29:00.155
Unless you wanna fucking die.

29:07.662 --> 29:08.663
Go ahead.

29:10.832 --> 29:11.875
What'd you say?

29:12.375 --> 29:14.252
You aren't going
to listen to us anyway.

29:15.462 --> 29:16.588
So just do it.

29:17.297 --> 29:19.174
I'll make sure to let you win.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.720
Fucking lunatic.

29:24.971 --> 29:26.806
Stop putting on that fucking act.

29:29.601 --> 29:31.644
You killed a guy
at your last school, am I right?

29:32.729 --> 29:33.772
No?

29:36.399 --> 29:37.609
Ah.

29:38.359 --> 29:41.112
I'm sorry, you put him in a coma,
but didn't kill him, right?

29:41.988 --> 29:42.989
A vegetable?

29:46.159 --> 29:47.786
Fuck, man.

29:48.661 --> 29:51.664
You ruined someone else's life,
so stop acting all high and mighty.

29:55.418 --> 29:57.128
What a fucking hypocrite.

30:17.357 --> 30:18.983
You goddamn shit.

30:47.637 --> 30:49.222
Son of a bitch!

31:01.192 --> 31:02.485
Ah. This motherfu…

31:04.279 --> 31:05.947
You're a sneaky little prick, aren't you?

31:06.865 --> 31:07.949
You asshole.

31:12.996 --> 31:14.497
Hey, gentlemen!

31:16.124 --> 31:17.876
It's been a freaking long time.

31:18.376 --> 31:19.919
How have you been, you sons of bitches?

31:22.630 --> 31:24.048
Were you two having fun?

31:25.550 --> 31:27.093
Motherfuckers.

31:30.054 --> 31:31.347
Destroy them all!

31:47.113 --> 31:49.908
What now, you fucker?
You gonna stab me with that? Huh?

31:51.951 --> 31:53.620
You shit!

31:56.372 --> 31:57.498
Hey! No!

32:10.637 --> 32:13.056
Kick him.
Shithead. Fucking asshole.

32:15.850 --> 32:18.102
Asshole. Come here, you shit!

32:18.186 --> 32:19.479
You fucking jerk!

32:20.104 --> 32:21.356
Aah!

32:24.025 --> 32:25.860
Fuck, man.

32:26.778 --> 32:29.113
You ain't shit, yeah?

32:34.285 --> 32:35.954
Everyone, freeze!

32:45.380 --> 32:46.965
- What?
- Huh?

32:48.257 --> 32:50.468
- Who the hell is that?
- What the fuck?

32:50.551 --> 32:52.595
- Is that Baku?
- It's Baku?

32:53.346 --> 32:55.640
THE WAY TO YOU

33:10.989 --> 33:12.907
Hey. Let's back up.

33:25.837 --> 33:26.879
Hey, Gotak.

33:28.381 --> 33:29.757
I'm Kang Baek-ho's spitting image.

33:32.844 --> 33:37.265
Have you even looked in a mirror?
Did you pour spicy malatang on your head?

33:42.478 --> 33:44.147
- Hyo-mans!
- Huh?

33:44.230 --> 33:47.942
What do you think, my dear Hyo-mans?
I look like Kang Baek-ho, right?

33:48.443 --> 33:51.446
Well, I haven't, uh,
been able to read that manga just yet, so…

33:52.488 --> 33:54.866
The thing is, this isn't how it looks.

33:54.949 --> 33:58.619
You could definitely,
easily misunderstand this situation.

33:58.703 --> 33:59.579
Huh.

34:01.414 --> 34:02.707
Wha…

34:06.169 --> 34:08.004
♪ Oh ♪

34:08.629 --> 34:11.215
♪ Crazy for you ♪

34:12.091 --> 34:14.802
♪ Crazy for you… ♪

34:18.473 --> 34:20.141
Projectile motion?

34:20.224 --> 34:22.685
The sum of the horizontal
distance traveled

34:22.769 --> 34:25.104
is proportional
to the square of the speed.

34:57.011 --> 34:58.054
And you are?

34:59.055 --> 35:00.598
I've never seen you before.

35:02.975 --> 35:05.269
You've got a lot of guts.
